WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.820
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.090 --> 01:40.030
[River of No Return]

3
01:40.050 --> 01:42.850
[Episode 4: Regicide]

4
01:42.920 --> 01:44.690
You weren't sent by Zhu Buhua.

5
01:51.240 --> 01:53.170
What kind of prescription is this?

6
01:54.740 --> 01:58.240
Veratrum, raw turtle shell, and whole crickets?

7
01:58.700 --> 02:00.160
Its effects can be potent.

8
02:00.320 --> 02:01.720
It can not only save lives

9
02:01.870 --> 02:03.400
but also turn yang into yin,

10
02:04.040 --> 02:05.730
killing people without a trace.

11
02:05.730 --> 02:06.790
You know medicine?

12
02:06.820 --> 02:08.020
I know people better.

13
02:08.449 --> 02:08.919
Speak.

14
02:10.100 --> 02:11.760
Who is this prescription for?

15
02:12.080 --> 02:13.540
What illness does he have?

16
02:17.480 --> 02:18.040
Eunuch,

17
02:18.420 --> 02:21.010
Yuan Zhongda submitted a secret report on Beijing to the Crown Prince.

18
02:21.010 --> 02:23.470
They are now playing go behind closed doors.

19
02:57.480 --> 02:58.350
Your Highness.

20
03:01.360 --> 03:05.190
[Hulan Hushiwen]

21
03:22.310 --> 03:23.130
Back then,

22
03:23.310 --> 03:24.690
Emperor Taizong

23
03:25.070 --> 03:27.160
ordered me to find someone.

24
03:27.750 --> 03:29.480
I accidentally learned about

25
03:29.660 --> 03:32.079
the secret passage in the Imperial City in Jinling,

26
03:32.079 --> 03:34.290
so I immediately went to the northern desert region

27
03:34.290 --> 03:36.290
to report it to Emperor Taizong.

28
03:58.360 --> 04:00.140
This is the secret passage

29
04:00.570 --> 04:02.030
inside the Imperial City.

30
04:03.920 --> 04:05.320
Have you got a good look?

31
04:08.700 --> 04:09.960
Have you memorized it?

32
04:11.070 --> 04:11.920
Yes, I have.

33
04:15.760 --> 04:16.450
Lord Yuan!

34
04:32.370 --> 04:33.230
Your Highness.

35
04:44.070 --> 04:45.010
Lord Yuan,

36
04:45.780 --> 04:46.960
have some pastries.

37
05:10.670 --> 05:14.200
You're the only one who knows the secret passage out of the palace.

38
05:14.200 --> 05:15.780
My life now rests

39
05:18.460 --> 05:19.930
in your hands.

40
05:29.570 --> 05:30.720
If you

41
05:34.400 --> 05:36.200
fall into Zhu Buhua's hands,

42
05:37.460 --> 05:39.130
you'll wish you were dead.

43
05:39.990 --> 05:40.880
If I...

44
05:44.170 --> 05:46.080
grant you death now,

45
05:47.720 --> 05:48.570
at least

46
05:49.950 --> 05:51.930
your honor will remain intact.

47
05:54.200 --> 05:55.659
Thank you, Your Highness.

48
05:58.430 --> 06:00.690
Thank you for your grace, Your Highness.

49
06:10.840 --> 06:11.810
Thank you, sir.

50
06:27.950 --> 06:30.080
Do you happen to have one of those...

51
06:30.510 --> 06:34.200
something handy you could use?

52
06:39.940 --> 06:44.970
♪ The boat fades into the night ♪

53
06:45.000 --> 06:50.450
♪ Oars carry the moonlight westward ♪

54
06:51.409 --> 06:56.450
♪ Lights flicker along the shore ♪

55
06:56.470 --> 07:01.700
♪ Why do they dim, and for whom do they glow? ♪

56
07:05.090 --> 07:10.700
♪ The road ahead churns without end ♪

57
07:11.050 --> 07:19.140
♪ Let the waves engulf me, and I won't look back ♪

58
07:31.650 --> 07:34.640
♪ I've seen the world's sorrow and joy ♪

59
07:34.670 --> 07:37.360
♪ I seek a world of peace and prosperity ♪

60
07:37.400 --> 07:39.020
♪ Only at journey's end will I understand ♪

61
07:39.020 --> 07:40.370
This is a plaything

62
07:42.130 --> 07:43.930
presented to me by Zheng Sanbao.

63
07:50.460 --> 07:52.760
Zheng Sanbao is really something.

64
07:52.990 --> 07:54.980
He really knows how to be an official.

65
07:54.980 --> 07:55.810
How does he

66
07:56.580 --> 07:59.430
always manage to make you so happy?

67
08:01.540 --> 08:02.870
I could never match him.

68
08:49.770 --> 08:50.640
Sir,

69
08:51.950 --> 08:53.080
I have no one

70
08:54.450 --> 08:56.410
left in Jinling whom I can trust.

71
09:07.920 --> 09:10.570
[The Battle of Hulan Hushiwen, the 13th year of Yongle reign]

72
09:25.930 --> 09:29.040
[Zhu Di, Emperor Taizong]

73
09:47.150 --> 09:49.900
[Young Zhu Zhanji]

74
10:01.860 --> 10:04.170
If you turn back to save them,

75
10:04.450 --> 10:06.180
you are unworthy of the throne.

76
10:08.550 --> 10:11.050
But if you forget them in the future,

77
10:11.580 --> 10:13.990
you are not fit to be a Zhu.

78
10:14.510 --> 10:16.800
Those who died for me in the past,

79
10:17.500 --> 10:18.720
I couldn't save.

80
10:20.170 --> 10:22.360
And those who die for me now,

81
10:22.810 --> 10:24.120
I will never forget.

82
10:25.410 --> 10:27.030
-I'll speak! I'll speak! -Speak!

83
10:27.030 --> 10:28.000
-I'll speak! -Speak!

84
10:28.000 --> 10:28.930
Speak right now!

85
10:28.960 --> 10:29.620
Let go of me!

86
10:30.770 --> 10:31.480
Speak.

87
10:33.840 --> 10:35.030
It's for Zhu Buhua.

88
10:35.460 --> 10:37.120
I prescribed it for Zhu Buhua.

89
10:37.200 --> 10:38.410
Zhu Buhua is not sick.

90
10:38.840 --> 10:39.720
My Lord,

91
10:40.170 --> 10:41.070
since you know medicine,

92
10:41.070 --> 10:42.470
you should be able to tell

93
10:42.670 --> 10:44.330
that I prescribed him poison.

94
10:44.600 --> 10:45.600
I want to kill him.

95
10:46.200 --> 10:46.960
What?

96
10:50.450 --> 10:51.720
I know Eunuch Zhu's

97
10:52.320 --> 10:53.200
favorite food

98
10:53.200 --> 10:55.410
is Fan's Roast Goose beyond Xuanjin Bridge.

99
10:55.410 --> 10:56.410
The owner of Fan's

100
10:56.820 --> 10:59.280
makes a small pot of fresh marinade every day

101
10:59.740 --> 11:01.480
just to cook goose meat for him.

102
11:02.450 --> 11:03.120
So...

103
11:04.220 --> 11:06.220
I bribed the shop assistant a little

104
11:06.890 --> 11:09.150
and added an ingredient to the marinade,

105
11:09.860 --> 11:10.990
Chatou bream liver.

106
11:11.080 --> 11:11.770
What liver?

107
11:12.530 --> 11:13.430
Don't interrupt.

108
11:13.430 --> 11:14.290
Chatou bream.

109
11:14.530 --> 11:16.200
Meng Haoran ate Chatou bream

110
11:16.740 --> 11:18.340
and died of a back carbuncle.

111
11:19.050 --> 11:20.000
Died?

112
11:20.240 --> 11:21.670
Who died? Meng what?

113
11:21.670 --> 11:23.400
Don't interrupt. Meng Haoran.

114
11:24.470 --> 11:27.330
Don't tell me you don't even know who Meng Haoran is.

115
11:28.860 --> 11:29.820
Of course I know.

116
11:30.470 --> 11:31.830
Don't look at me like that.

117
11:31.830 --> 11:33.960
I'll go to his house to verify it later.

118
11:34.170 --> 11:34.840
Go on.

119
11:38.740 --> 11:40.120
In a few days at most,

120
11:41.570 --> 11:43.960
Zhu Buhua will die of a carbuncle.

121
11:45.480 --> 11:46.670
Why do you want to kill him?

122
11:46.670 --> 11:48.170
He killed my close friend.

123
11:48.720 --> 11:50.380
I want him to pay with his life!

124
12:25.620 --> 12:26.840
Where are my people?

125
12:27.050 --> 12:28.450
Where else could they be?

126
12:28.770 --> 12:29.970
Rebellious traitors

127
12:30.080 --> 12:31.600
are naturally locked in prison awaiting trial.

128
12:31.600 --> 12:32.550
Traitors?

129
12:39.170 --> 12:40.100
Traitors?

130
12:41.070 --> 12:41.860
If we are traitors,

131
12:41.860 --> 12:43.320
then what are you, Eunuch?

132
12:45.070 --> 12:46.690
A mad dog who bit its master?

133
12:52.580 --> 12:55.040
Eunuch Zhu, you've been delaying your move.

134
12:56.200 --> 12:57.410
Are you backing out?

135
12:59.200 --> 13:01.080
If you hadn't failed repeatedly,

136
13:01.650 --> 13:03.910
I wouldn't have had to clean up your mess.

137
13:04.620 --> 13:06.450
That's not fair, Eunuch Zhu.

138
13:07.000 --> 13:08.430
What the Iron Alliance promised your master

139
13:08.430 --> 13:10.910
was just to load the Huliu explosive onto the ship.

140
13:10.910 --> 13:13.880
You were the one who had Guo Zhimin bring the explosives out of the palace.

141
13:13.880 --> 13:16.480
Technically, your crime is greater than ours.

142
13:17.250 --> 13:19.510
We have helped you silence Guo Zhimin.

143
13:20.100 --> 13:21.830
What are you still waiting for?

144
13:22.860 --> 13:26.320
Now the whole world knows the Crown Prince has entered the Imperial City.

145
13:26.320 --> 13:27.770
If I make a move now,

146
13:28.050 --> 13:29.850
wouldn't it be telling the world

147
13:30.340 --> 13:33.940
that I, Zhu Buhua, am a traitor who killed his emperor and father?

148
13:34.410 --> 13:36.470
You've been a traitor for a long time.

149
13:49.360 --> 13:50.650
Since ancient times,

150
13:52.050 --> 13:53.600
those who play both sides

151
13:54.220 --> 13:56.570
never end up well.

152
13:57.530 --> 13:59.360
I'm just leaving myself

153
13:59.530 --> 14:01.120
a way out.

154
14:20.220 --> 14:21.120
Eunuch Zhu,

155
14:21.930 --> 14:23.730
there's no need to overthink it.

156
14:27.450 --> 14:29.410
Just make it look like a young eunuch trying to win favor

157
14:29.410 --> 14:31.940
but failing that, planning to commit murder.

158
14:34.500 --> 14:35.320
Except for me,

159
14:38.410 --> 14:40.870
no one will know you killed the Crown Prince.

160
14:41.780 --> 14:42.930
When was your

161
14:42.980 --> 14:44.800
last follow-up with Eunuch Zhu?

162
14:45.700 --> 14:46.730
Once at noon yesterday,

163
14:46.730 --> 14:47.950
and once at midnight.

164
14:49.150 --> 14:50.480
Yesterday at noon?

165
14:51.030 --> 14:54.380
Zhu Buhua should have been at Dongshuiguan Wharf to receive the imperial procession.

166
14:54.380 --> 14:56.930
Why did he have to schedule the follow-up at that time?

167
14:56.930 --> 14:59.170
Did he deliberately skip it?

168
15:00.660 --> 15:02.120
Wait. Where are you going?

169
15:02.580 --> 15:03.840
Zhu Buhua is a suspect.

170
15:03.840 --> 15:05.970
I must report this to the Crown Prince!

171
15:32.290 --> 15:33.490
Great-grandfather,

172
15:34.320 --> 15:35.520
Great-grandmother.

173
15:39.390 --> 15:42.430
[Spirit Tablet of Empress Xiao Ci Gao of the Great Ming]

174
15:43.960 --> 15:44.930
Grandfather,

175
15:46.000 --> 15:46.960
Grandmother.

176
15:49.810 --> 15:50.960
I am now

177
15:52.860 --> 15:54.860
trapped in this secondary capital.

178
15:55.830 --> 15:56.900
But I

179
15:59.250 --> 16:01.230
will never fail the Ming Empire.

180
16:02.600 --> 16:05.460
Grandfather, I will always remember the teachings

181
16:07.240 --> 16:09.170
you have given me since childhood.

182
16:34.520 --> 16:36.510
If I ever forget them,

183
16:37.720 --> 16:38.600
I won't deserve

184
16:41.390 --> 16:43.120
to be a member of the Zhu family.

185
17:22.010 --> 17:22.599
Loose!

186
18:11.540 --> 18:12.480
Eunuch Zhu!

187
18:13.580 --> 18:15.840
Come and see your precious Crown Prince.

188
18:24.350 --> 18:26.060
I didn't want this.

189
18:27.630 --> 18:29.290
Only if you die, Crown Prince,

190
18:30.740 --> 18:32.930
can I live.

191
18:53.610 --> 18:55.940
Is that what your Crown Prince looks like?

192
19:04.200 --> 19:05.560
Little Sixi?

193
19:17.720 --> 19:18.850
Zhu Buhua.

194
19:22.170 --> 19:22.960
Who is it?

195
19:23.650 --> 19:24.480
Who's there?

196
19:24.870 --> 19:25.800
Come out!

197
19:26.190 --> 19:27.610
You! You!

198
19:27.910 --> 19:29.720
Come out! Come out!

199
19:32.760 --> 19:33.850
Zhu Buhua.

200
19:34.670 --> 19:36.600
You are disloyal and unrighteous.

201
19:37.000 --> 19:38.890
Grandfather misjudged you!

202
19:39.480 --> 19:41.450
Stop playing tricks!

203
19:41.910 --> 19:43.090
Who are you?

204
19:45.240 --> 19:46.040
Who are you?

205
19:46.460 --> 19:47.450
Who is it?

206
19:47.830 --> 19:48.480
Who is it?

207
20:03.630 --> 20:04.280
Zhu Wu!

208
20:05.020 --> 20:05.720
Go after him!

209
20:05.720 --> 20:06.240
Yes!

210
20:08.800 --> 20:09.610
Hurry up!

211
20:45.280 --> 20:46.280
Check over there!

212
21:15.040 --> 21:15.650
Eunuch!

213
21:16.760 --> 21:18.160
Lord Yuan's body is here.

214
23:01.350 --> 23:03.760
Little Sixi, the attendant of the Crown Prince's bedchamber...

215
23:03.760 --> 23:05.360
Poisoned the Prince's meal.

216
23:05.560 --> 23:07.560
When discovered by His Highness...

217
23:07.610 --> 23:09.910
He suddenly flew into a rage and attempted to kill His Highness.

218
23:09.910 --> 23:11.970
The Crown Prince was murdered by him!

219
23:13.090 --> 23:14.220
Imperial Guards!

220
23:14.450 --> 23:15.650
Deploy all forces!

221
23:16.480 --> 23:17.930
Search every palace!

222
23:18.150 --> 23:18.800
Yes!

223
23:39.820 --> 23:40.520
Report!

224
23:43.650 --> 23:44.220
Eunuch,

225
23:44.410 --> 23:45.760
we've searched the area around Fengxian Hall, Dashan Hall,

226
23:45.760 --> 23:46.450
and Rouyi Hall.

227
23:46.450 --> 23:47.500
No sign of the fugitive.

228
23:47.500 --> 23:48.330
Report!

229
23:49.500 --> 23:50.000
Eunuch,

230
23:50.090 --> 23:51.170
we've searched the area around Chunhe Palace

231
23:51.170 --> 23:51.960
and Wenhua Hall.

232
23:51.960 --> 23:53.150
No sign of the fugitive.

233
23:53.150 --> 23:53.800
Report!

234
23:54.040 --> 23:54.650
Eunuch,

235
23:54.720 --> 23:55.850
we've searched all three main halls.

236
23:55.850 --> 23:56.980
No sign of the fugitive.

237
23:56.980 --> 23:57.720
Keep searching.

238
23:57.720 --> 23:58.380
-Yes! -Yes!

239
24:03.740 --> 24:04.400
Godfather.

240
25:23.320 --> 25:24.620
Godfather, it's here!

241
25:39.870 --> 25:40.700
Have you searched it?

242
25:40.700 --> 25:41.330
Not yet.

243
25:41.520 --> 25:42.700
What are you waiting for?

244
25:42.700 --> 25:43.280
Yes.

245
25:49.110 --> 25:49.710
You three,

246
25:49.760 --> 25:50.360
follow me!

247
25:50.450 --> 25:51.170
-Yes! -Yes!

248
28:48.980 --> 28:50.130
Take 10 paces

249
28:51.110 --> 28:53.040
down to the drainage channel.

250
29:07.580 --> 29:08.780
After 50 paces,

251
29:10.100 --> 29:12.690
exit the channel and turn right.

252
29:18.610 --> 29:20.670
Go to the end

253
29:37.100 --> 29:38.630
and break through the wall.

254
30:46.130 --> 30:46.830
You two,

255
30:47.070 --> 30:47.730
go this way!

256
30:48.040 --> 30:49.020
You, follow me.

257
32:18.830 --> 32:19.490
Godfather!

258
32:19.700 --> 32:20.360
Godfather!

259
32:25.890 --> 32:27.310
This is the Crown Prince's jade pendant.

260
32:27.310 --> 32:28.070
And this.

261
32:32.090 --> 32:34.220
He wouldn't take these things with him

262
32:34.260 --> 32:36.320
if he were trying to escape, would he?

263
32:37.350 --> 32:39.150
An emperor's ceremonial crown?

264
32:40.590 --> 32:42.790
This is Zhu Yunwen's ceremonial crown.

265
32:43.450 --> 32:45.130
Zhu Yunwen?

266
32:47.220 --> 32:48.420
The Emperor Jianwen?

267
32:48.720 --> 32:50.000
So this is how Zhu Yunwen

268
32:50.000 --> 32:51.690
escaped back then.

269
32:52.980 --> 32:56.040
That's why the Crown Prince wanted to see Yuan Zhongda.

270
32:56.170 --> 32:58.830
From the 5th to the 21st year of the Yongle reign,

271
32:59.040 --> 33:00.890
Yuan Zhongda spent 16 years

272
33:00.910 --> 33:03.970
searching for Zhu Yunwen on behalf of Emperor Taizong.

273
33:04.060 --> 33:05.480
That old fox

274
33:06.410 --> 33:09.610
must have revealed this secret passage to the Crown Prince

275
33:09.610 --> 33:10.980
while they were playing go today.

276
33:10.980 --> 33:11.720
From the very beginning,

277
33:11.720 --> 33:14.330
the only person he really wanted to see was Yuan Zhongda.

278
33:14.330 --> 33:15.790
He'd been wary of you

279
33:15.820 --> 33:17.680
ever since he entered the palace.

280
33:23.720 --> 33:25.040
Where does this secret passage lead?

281
33:25.040 --> 33:26.450
It should lead to the Qinhuai River.

282
33:26.450 --> 33:28.130
All the palace drainage channels

283
33:28.130 --> 33:29.790
empty into the Qinhuai River.

284
33:30.640 --> 33:33.480
If the Crown Prince really makes it into the Qinhuai River,

285
33:33.480 --> 33:35.040
no one will ever find him.

286
33:36.630 --> 33:37.370
Envoy,

287
33:37.760 --> 33:38.820
you can go back now.

288
33:39.540 --> 33:40.840
Follow me up the city wall!

289
33:40.840 --> 33:41.540
Yes!

290
34:59.240 --> 34:59.900
Over there!

291
34:59.940 --> 35:00.750
Over there!

292
35:09.720 --> 35:10.340
Move!

293
35:25.230 --> 35:26.090
Draw your bows!

294
35:32.960 --> 35:33.480
Loose!

295
35:57.310 --> 35:58.080
One.

296
36:00.020 --> 36:00.640
Two.

297
36:05.230 --> 36:06.210
Three.

298
36:10.930 --> 36:11.840
Four.

299
37:44.750 --> 37:48.900
[Zhu Gaoxi, Prince Han]

300
38:21.990 --> 38:25.260
A strange thing happened in my hometown last year.

301
38:25.980 --> 38:29.560
An old woman had been bedridden with a chronic illness for years.

302
38:29.560 --> 38:32.230
A traveling physician gave her

303
38:32.600 --> 38:35.260
a prescription for Yang-restoring Decoction.

304
38:35.660 --> 38:38.080
After taking it, her qi and blood recovered,

305
38:38.080 --> 38:39.810
and she was able to move about freely again.

306
38:39.810 --> 38:41.670
It was truly a miraculous remedy.

307
38:43.660 --> 38:45.120
Do you think my sister-in-law

308
38:45.120 --> 38:46.580
will fall for this?

309
38:46.800 --> 38:47.290
[Lord Song, Vice Minister of Rites]

310
38:47.290 --> 38:48.990
Whether she believes it is up to her.

311
38:48.990 --> 38:50.750
But she won't have much choice.

312
38:52.160 --> 38:53.600
At a time like this,

313
38:54.330 --> 38:57.190
you are pulling out all the stops.

314
38:57.600 --> 38:59.330
Do you really think it'll work?

315
38:59.950 --> 39:02.640
It may not work for me,

316
39:03.310 --> 39:05.730
but for Your Highness, Prince Han...

317
39:05.730 --> 39:06.960
Are you saying

318
39:07.710 --> 39:10.500
you want to give it to me as a token of your affection?

319
39:10.500 --> 39:11.370
Precisely.

320
39:11.390 --> 39:12.240
Why?

321
39:13.040 --> 39:16.500
Giving it to you is giving it to myself.

322
39:19.750 --> 39:22.480
Have you been carrying this prescription on you?

323
39:47.340 --> 39:47.970
You...

324
39:48.520 --> 39:50.060
Anyway, Eunuch Zhu has ordered

325
39:50.060 --> 39:51.100
that no one may enter or leave

326
39:51.100 --> 39:52.520
without his personal written authorization!

327
39:52.520 --> 39:53.450
Look carefully.

328
39:53.680 --> 39:55.450
This is Lord Zheng He's token.

329
39:55.500 --> 39:56.770
I must go in today!

330
39:57.140 --> 39:58.250
I must see Eunuch Zhu!

331
39:58.250 --> 39:58.810
Stop him!

332
39:58.840 --> 39:59.850
What are you doing?

333
39:59.850 --> 40:00.350
You...

334
40:00.950 --> 40:01.890
Don't move! Behave yourself.

335
40:01.890 --> 40:05.480
Let go! Let go! Let go!

336
40:09.040 --> 40:11.170
That treacherous bastard, Zhu Buhua.

337
40:11.480 --> 40:13.160
He's probably already made his move.

338
40:13.160 --> 40:14.890
That Crown Prince of yours

339
40:14.910 --> 40:16.740
is an old mule.

340
40:17.170 --> 40:18.620
I told him not to enter the palace,

341
40:18.620 --> 40:19.950
but he wouldn't listen.

342
40:20.160 --> 40:20.930
Now look.

343
40:21.000 --> 40:21.830
He can't get out.

344
40:21.830 --> 40:23.290
Stop wasting my time with all this nonsense.

345
40:23.290 --> 40:24.220
Our top priority

346
40:24.310 --> 40:26.170
is figuring out how to get inside.

347
40:26.410 --> 40:27.680
As things stand,

348
40:28.830 --> 40:30.890
we have no choice but to take a gamble.

349
40:31.390 --> 40:32.320
Little Xingren,

350
40:32.460 --> 40:34.000
head southeast.

351
40:34.390 --> 40:36.390
Dr. Su and I will handle things here.

352
40:36.820 --> 40:37.990
Whether we succeed or not,

353
40:37.990 --> 40:40.290
we'll meet at the 5th house in the middle lane

354
40:40.290 --> 40:43.020
of Tangfanglang, northwest of Zhenhuai Bridge.

355
40:55.660 --> 40:56.720
Which house again?

356
40:57.450 --> 40:58.250
The 5th house.

357
40:58.690 --> 40:59.140
Okay.

358
40:59.200 --> 41:00.130
Useless fool.

359
41:00.330 --> 41:00.930
Go now!

360
41:05.040 --> 41:06.250
So where are we going?

361
41:06.710 --> 41:07.730
Nowhere.

362
41:08.530 --> 41:10.450
So you sent him away on purpose?

363
41:13.890 --> 41:14.750
Smart.

364
41:17.980 --> 41:19.680
Now it's just you and me.

365
41:20.540 --> 41:22.680
No need to beat around the bush, right?

366
41:23.330 --> 41:24.850
Are you trying to save the Crown Prince

367
41:24.850 --> 41:25.770
or kill him?

368
41:25.820 --> 41:26.360
Speak!

369
41:28.320 --> 41:30.410
I've never intended to kill the Crown Prince!

370
41:30.410 --> 41:31.810
I'm here to kill Zhu Buhua,

371
41:31.810 --> 41:33.270
that treacherous eunuch!

372
41:46.830 --> 41:48.160
Search along the river!

373
41:48.200 --> 41:49.100
I want him,

374
41:49.310 --> 41:50.250
alive or dead!

375
42:07.140 --> 42:08.770
What are you doing? Let me go!

376
42:09.390 --> 42:10.530
Why should I listen to you?

377
42:10.530 --> 42:11.810
You think you can just put your arms around me whenever you want,

378
42:11.810 --> 42:12.620
then let go whenever you please?

379
42:12.620 --> 42:14.020
Well, I'm not letting go.

380
42:15.410 --> 42:16.430
I won't let go!

381
42:18.370 --> 42:18.950
You...

382
42:19.830 --> 42:20.460
Let go!

383
42:24.290 --> 42:25.420
Good-for-Nothing,

384
42:25.800 --> 42:26.310
don't forget

385
42:26.310 --> 42:27.890
why you brought me here.

386
42:34.390 --> 42:35.250
Then why

387
42:36.000 --> 42:36.730
are you here?

388
42:48.290 --> 42:49.090
Nothing here!

389
42:51.080 --> 42:51.880
Nothing here!

390
43:01.770 --> 43:02.430
Godfather!

391
43:02.680 --> 43:03.340
Godfather!

392
43:03.540 --> 43:04.200
Godfather!

393
43:04.830 --> 43:07.080
We've arranged for people to search the river and the banks.

394
43:07.080 --> 43:08.340
Did you find anything?

395
43:09.040 --> 43:09.850
Not yet.
